  questionText:
  - language: English
    text: "Why is the \u03B1-carbon of an amino acid a chiral center?"
  - language: German
    text: "Warum ist der \u03B1-Kohlenstoff einer Aminos\xE4ure ein Chiralit\xE4tszentrum?"
  answers:
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Because it carries two identical substituents
    - language: German
      text: "Weil er zwei gleiche Substituenten tr\xE4gt"
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Because it carries four different substituents
    - language: German
      text: "Weil er vier verschiedene Substituenten tr\xE4gt"
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Because it is electrically charged
    - language: German
      text: Weil er elektrisch geladen ist
  - texts:
    - language: English
      text: Because it is part of an aromatic ring
    - language: German
      text: Weil er Teil eines Aromaten ist
  correctAnswer: 2
